<title>HONG KONG: Lai Sun Development sets HK$1.5 bln loan.</title>
<headline>Lai Sun Development sets HK$1.5 bln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by arranger Schroders Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LAI SUN DEVELOPMENT CO LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$1.5 BLN  TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN     H+160BP     MATURITY  3 YRS    AVGE LIFE  --</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS     NONE     LAUNCHED   04.DEC.96</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN   --	    AVAIL     --	 HOME CTRY  HONG KONG</p>
<p>REPAYMENT  SEMIANNUAL UNEQUAL INSTALMENTS</p>
<p> REPLIES    BEFORE CHRISTMAS 1996</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  BA ASIA, SCHRODERS ASIA, BANKERS TRUST CO HONG KONG</p>
<p>		AND DEUTSCHE BANK HONG KONG.</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS    HK$80 MLN+    30.0BP</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	   HK$50-75 MLN  22.5BP</p>
<p> NOTES   PROCEEDS ARE TO BE USED FOR REFINANCING DEBT CONNECTED</p>
<p>	   WITH THE BORROWER'S CHEUNG SHA WAN PLAZA OFFICE</p>
<p>	   COMPLEX.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
